Description: DriveLink agent: shares DriveLink devices over TCP
 drivelink-agent owns the serial ports of DriveLink devices (ESP32-S3 motion
 controllers) and shares them with the GUI, the CLI and ROS 2, with access
 control and a control lease. It runs as the drivelink-agent service on
 127.0.0.1 with a generated token until /etc/drivelink/agent.json lists
 devices; an upgrade never restarts the running agent.
